{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_75e3deaf30f243bcb0147290","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 发送消息\n2\t\n3\t向其他 Agent 的收件箱发送消息。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```\n7\t写入目标 Agent 的 inbox 目录：\n8\tD:\\loopcli\\<目标agent名>\\inbox\\<自己的名字>_<时间戳>.md\n9\t```\n10\t\n11\t## 文件格式\n12\t```markdown\n13\t# 来自 <你的名字>\n14\t- 类型：任务完成 / 通知 / 错误报告\n15\t- 内容：具体信息\n16\t```\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b92ba1127ba343069f316c5b","session_id":"4fc1920c-0b5c-4266-b43d-05c38f749fa3","uuid":"ca535c29-bbfd-47af-a861-dac503ed3f37","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:22:09.497Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read global skills"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_4c3156706261430e9bfc5761","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 汇报状态\n2\t\n3\t完成任务后更新自己的状态文件。\n4\t\n5\t```bash\n6\t# 更新 state.json\n7\t{\n8\t  \"status\": \"idle\",\n9\t  \"last_run\": \"<当前时间>\",\n10\t  \"run_count\": \"<自增>\"\n11\t}\n12\t```\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b92ba1127ba343069f316c5b","session_id":"4fc1920c-0b5c-4266-b43d-05c38f749fa3","uuid":"91de0170-0bb6-4fc8-8d66-abf439afe43d","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:22:09.498Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read global skills"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_59e14951dc90472386aafdb1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 收件箱\n2\t\n3\t每个 Agent 有自己的收件箱，用于接收消息和任务结果。\n4\t\n5\t## 位置\n6\t`D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\`\n7\t\n8\t## 用法\n9\t发送消息给某 Agent：\n10\t```\n11\t写入 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\<来源>_<时间戳>.md\n12\t```\n13\t\n14\t格式：\n15\t```markdown\n16\t# 来自 <来源> 的消息\n17\t- 类型：任务结果 / 通知 / 协作请求\n18\t- 内容：...\n19\t```\n20\t\n21\t## 示例\n22\t- `main\\inbox\\code-reviewer_20260521.md` — 代码审查员发给 main 的审查报告\n23\t- `frontend-dev\\inbox\\main_20260521.md` — main 给前端开发者的新需求\n24\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b92ba1127ba343069f316c5b","session_id":"4fc1920c-0b5c-4266-b43d-05c38f749fa3","uuid":"f16783f5-216f-4f3b-aa3b-c506ad744da1","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:22:09.837Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read global skills"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_634b51a8afb64381abf3f448","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 派发任务\n2\t\n3\t给已有 Agent 添加新任务。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli task <agent目录名> \"任务标题\" --desc \"任务描述\"\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 执行逻辑\n11\t1. 找到 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>/memory/tasks.json\n12\t2. 追加新任务：{ id: 自增, status: \"pending\", title, description, created, assignee }\n13\t3. 写回 tasks.json\n14\t\n15\t## 示例\n16\t```bash\n17\tloopcli task engineering-frontend-developer \"优化首页加载\" --desc \"Lighthouse 60分 → 90+\"\n18\tloopcli task main \"部署到生产环境\" --desc \"合并 staging 分支并部署\"\n19\t```\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b92ba1127ba343069f316c5b","session_id":"4fc1920c-0b5c-4266-b43d-05c38f749fa3","uuid":"b62e1b6c-3e94-4ee6-8651-e51f0a1c97df","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:22:09.838Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read global skills"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_a0e9f7f2907c4589aa0c2e31","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 创建 Agent\n2\t\n3\t从模板库创建新 Agent，自动注册到 loopcli。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli create <模板ID> --task \"任务描述\"\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 模板位置\n11\tD:\\loopcli\\subagent\\，按部门分目录。模板文件格式：`<部门>/<模板ID>.md`\n12\t例如：`engineering/engineering-frontend-developer.md`\n13\t\n14\t## 执行逻辑\n15\t1. 从 subagent/<部门>/<模板ID>.md 读取模板内容\n16\t2. 在 D:\\loopcli\\<模板ID>/ 下创建目录结构：\n17\t   - AGENT（标记文件，内容为 `type: main`）\n18\t   - SOUL.md（模板内容）\n19\t   - PROMPT.md（自动生成：读取 SOUL.md，读取 memory/tasks.json，执行任务，更新状态）\n20\t   - memory/tasks.json（含传入的任务）\n21\t   - memory/state.json（初始状态）\n22\t   - log/run.md（空日志）\n23\t3. loopcli 下一轮自动发现并启动该 Agent\n24\t\n25\t## 示例\n26\t```bash\n27\tloopcli create engineering-frontend-developer --task \"开发登录页面\"\n28\tloopcli create engineering-code-reviewer --task \"审查 PR #42\"\n29\tloopcli create design-ui-designer --task \"设计仪表盘界面\"\n30\t```\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_b92ba1127ba343069f316c5b","session_id":"4fc1920c-0b5c-4266-b43d-05c38f749fa3","uuid":"1f0e58a7-8f75-419e-aef5-f4d0888f639e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:22:09.839Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Read global skills"}
