{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_b92ba1127ba343069f316c5b","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere's a summary of each skill's purpose:\n\n## Skills Summary\n\n1. **report.md** - Update status after completing tasks by modifying state.json files.\n2. **inbox.md** - Manage each agent's inbox directory for receiving messages and task results.\n3. **outbox.md** - Send messages to other agents' inbox directories.\n4. **create-agent.md** - Create new agents from templates and automatically register them to loopcli.\n5. **assign-task.md** - Add new tasks to existing agents using the loopcli task command.\n6. **list-agents.md** - View all registered agents and their statuses including task counts.\n7. **token-saving.md** - Optimize token usage by limiting output, avoiding extra work, and maintaining idle status.\n8. **web-scraper.md** - Automate web data collection with three cost levels for static/dynamic/AI-driven scraping.\n9. **content-generator.md** - Generate monetizable digital assets like technical articles, tools templates, and course content.\n10. **topic-tracker.md** - Automatically track trending topics from Hacker News for content generation data.\n11. **cost-optimizer.md** - Complete token visibility and cost control using the alexgreensh/token-optimizer package."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4fc1920c-0b5c-4266-b43d-05c38f749fa3","uuid":"92562404-8053-421a-8fba-e61e0ed8c24f","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:22:31.739Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read all skill files in D:/loopcli/skill/ directory. Read each .md file and provide a summary of each skill's purpose. Files: report.md, inbox.md, outbox.md, create-agent.md, assign-task.md, list-agents.md, token-saving.md, web-scraper.md, content-generator.md, topic-tracker.md, cost-optimizer.md. Give a brief one-line summary for each.","agentId":"a7f3c9ae2267f324f","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nH